{
  "about": "Cases for what Discord's page reports and what it is sent (src/shared/ipc.ts): isDiscordState and isRelayedNotification, which the desktop's main process runs on the Discord view's messages and the phone's native code runs on its Discord view's (mobile/android DiscordValidators.kt, DiscordValidatorsTest); isBridgePayload, which the preload runs on the main-world store bridge's output; isDiscordTarget, for navigation sent to the page; and isDiscordPage, for Discord's own pages. tests/shared/discordCases.test.ts runs them against the TypeScript. Values are JSON with expansions: {\"$repeat\": s, \"times\": n} repeats a string; {\"$list\": value, \"times\": n} makes a list of n values ({i} in its strings becomes the index); {\"$text\": [parts]} joins strings and code points (numbers); n is a number or a limit's name from limits, optionally +1 or -1.",
